                <head>399. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>The Second Law of the Sea Conference met at Geneva March 17–April 26, with 88
                    nations represented. Arthur H. Dean again headed the U.S. Delegation. For
                    summary records of the plenary meetings, meetings of the Committee of the Whole,
                    and the texts of the various proposals submitted, see <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Second United Nations Conference on the law of the Sea, Official
                        Records</hi>, U.N. doc. A/CONF.19/8.</p>
            </div>
